
>> g := ['global'].
{ >> g := ['local']. Tawm sau-ntawv: g, kab-tshiab. } pib. 
Tawm sau-ntawv: g, kab-tshiab. 
>> message := ['Bye'].
>> Secret := Yam-khoom tshiab.
Secret thaum-tuaj: ['kev-sim'] ua: {
	>> message := ['Hello'].
	nws-li message := ['World'].
	Tawm sau-ntawv: message + [' '] + nws-li message, kab-tshiab.
}.
Secret kev-sim.
Tawm sau-ntawv: message.
